        "id": "s8",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/59478/000005947816000395/a8-kceoannouncement2016.htm",
        "title": "Eli Lilly and Company, Form 8-K (CEO succession), July 27, 2016",
        "published_at": "2016-07-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "On the same day, the company announced that the board of directors elected David A. Ricks as president and chief executive officer of the company, effective January 1, 2017.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s9",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/59478/000005947816000395/a8-kceoannouncement2016.htm",
        "title": "Eli Lilly and Company, Form 8-K (CEO succession), July 27, 2016",
        "published_at": "2016-07-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Also on July 27, 2016, the company announced that the board of directors elected Mr. Ricks as a director, effective January 1, 2017, and as chairman of the board of directors, effective June 1, 2017.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s10",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/59478/000005947816000395/a8-kceoannouncement2016.htm",
        "title": "Eli Lilly and Company, Form 8-K (CEO succession), July 27, 2016",
        "published_at": "2016-07-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Ricks, age 49, has served as senior vice president of Lilly, and president of Lilly Bio-Medicines, the company’s largest business area, since January 2012.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s11",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/59478/000005947816000395/a8-kceoannouncement2016.htm",
        "title": "Eli Lilly and Company, Form 8-K (CEO succession), July 27, 2016",
        "published_at": "2016-07-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Before assuming his current position, he served as general manager of Canada from 2005-2008, as the general manager of China from 2008-2009, and as the president of Lilly USA from 2009-2012.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s12",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/796343/000079634326000043/adbe-20260227.htm",
        "title": "Adobe Inc., 2026 Proxy Statement (Schedule 14A)",
        "published_at": "2026-02-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Ricks, 58, has served as President and Chief Executive Officer of Eli Lilly and Company, a pharmaceutical company (“Eli Lilly”), since January 2017 and as Chair of the board of directors of Eli Lilly since June 2017.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s13",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/796343/000079634326000043/adbe-20260227.htm",
        "title": "Adobe Inc., 2026 Proxy Statement (Schedule 14A)",
        "published_at": "2026-02-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Ricks served as general manager of Lilly Canada from 2005 to 2008, after roles as Director of Pharmaceutical Marketing and National Sales Director in Canada.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s14",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/796343/000079634326000043/adbe-20260227.htm",
        "title": "Adobe Inc., 2026 Proxy Statement (Schedule 14A)",
        "published_at": "2026-02-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Ricks joined Eli Lilly in 1996 as a Business Development Associate and held several management roles in U.S. marketing and sales before moving to Lilly Canada.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s15",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/796343/000079634326000043/adbe-20260227.htm",
        "title": "Adobe Inc., 2026 Proxy Statement (Schedule 14A)",
        "published_at": "2026-02-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Ricks earned a B.S. from Purdue University in 1990 and an M.B.A. from Indiana University in 1996.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s16",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/796343/000079634326000043/adbe-20260227.htm",
        "title": "Adobe Inc., 2026 Proxy Statement (Schedule 14A)",
        "published_at": "2026-02-27",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "DIRECTOR SINCE 2018",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s17",
