        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Ricks earned a Bachelor of Science degree in Industrial Management (BSIM) with a focus on Industrial Engineering from Purdue in 1990 and an MBA from Indiana University in 1996.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
